<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EmployeeHub - <%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/contact.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.3.1/css/all.css" integrity="sha512-x9WwyMYBnlXMNQ6kQ/Lyzu1NqIhLQKL5Oq6xByfXuRj7s9CskyCbLv/1IjqzJmXwFXWr0ov6jBV7Qbc0hh9nHg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("partials/navbar") %>
    <main class="contact-page">
        <section class="contact-hero">
            <div class="contact-badge">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i>SUPPORT CENTER
            </div>
            <h1>How can we <span>help you?</span></h1>
            <p>Have a question about EmployeeHub? Need help managing your employees? Our support team is here to help.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="contact-cards">
            <div class="contact-card">
                <div class="card-icon purple">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <span>EMAIL SUPPORT</span>
                    <h3>support@employeehub.com</h3>
                    <p>Get help from our support team.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-arrow">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-card">
                <div class="card-icon blue">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <span>PHONE SUPPORT</span>
                    <h3>+91 80772 25763</h3>
                    <p>Mon - Fri · 10:00 AM - 6:00 PM</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-arrow">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-card">
                <div class="card-icon cyan">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <span>OUR OFFICE</span>
                    <h3>New Delhi, India</h3>
                    <p>Available during business hours.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-arrow">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="contact-area">
            <div class="contact-left">
                <div class="section-label">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-comments"></i>GET IN TOUCH
                </div>
                <h2>Let's start a <span>conversation.</span></h2>
                <p class="contact-description">Whether you're facing an issue, have a suggestion, or simply want to learn more about EmployeeHub, send us a message.</p>
                <div class="support-list">
                    <div class="support-item">
                        <div class="support-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Quick Response</strong>
                            <p>We usually respond within 24 hours.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="support-item">
                        <div class="support-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Secure Communication</strong>
                            <p>Your information remains private.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="support-item">
                        <div class="support-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Dedicated Support</strong>
                            <p>Our team is ready to assist you.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="follow-us">
                    <span>Follow EmployeeHub</span>
                    <div class="social-icons">
                        <a href="/"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
                        <a href="/"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
                        <a href="/"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                        <a href="/"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form-card">
                <div class="form-top">
                    <div>
                        <span>CONTACT FORM</span>
                        <h2>Send us a message</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-top-icon">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-paper-plane"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <form id="contactForm">
                    <div class="form-row">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Full Name</label>
                            <div class="input-wrapper">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i>
                                <input id="fullName" type="text" placeholder="Your name">
                            </div>
                            <small id="nameError"></small>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Email Address</label>
                            <div class="input-wrapper">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
                                <input id="emailID" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
                            </div>
                            <small id="emailError"></small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Subject</label>
                        <div class="input-wrapper">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-list"></i>
                            <select id="selectSubject">
                                <option value="">Select a subject</option>
                                <option>General Question</option>
                                <option>Technical Support</option>
                                <option>Employee Management</option>
                                <option>Feedback</option>
                                <option>Other</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <small id="subjectError"></small>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Message</label>
                        <div class="textarea-wrapper">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-message"></i>
                            <textarea id="textareaText" placeholder="Tell us how we can help..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <small id="messageError"></small>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="send-button">Send Message<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
                    <p class="form-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>Your information is secure and will only be used to respond to your request.</p>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="faq-section">
            <div class="faq-title">
                <div class="section-label">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-question"></i>QUICK HELP
                </div>
                <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
                <p>Find quick answers to common EmployeeHub questions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-grid">
                <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-number">01</div>
                    <h3>How do I add a new employee?</h3>
                    <p>Navigate to the Add Employee page and enter the required employee information.</p>
                    <a href="/help">Learn more<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-number">02</div>
                    <h3>How can I update employee details?
                    </h3>
                    <p>Open the Employees section, select an employee and use the edit option.</p>
                    <a href="/help">Learn more<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-number">03</div>
                    <h3>Can I view all employees?</h3>
                    <p>Yes. The Employees section provides a complete overview of registered employees.</p>
                    <a href="/employees">Learn more<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <div class="success-toast" id="successToast">
        <div class="toast-icon">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="toast-content">
            <strong>Message sent</strong>
            <span>We'll get back to you shortly.</span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="toast-close" id="toastClose">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
        </button>
    </div>
    <%- include("partials/footer") %>
    <script src="/js/navbar.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/contact.js"></script>
</body>
</html>